    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 10.2,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "It's quite hot water, but let's do our best, Riri-chan."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 15.1,
      "end_time": 15.9,
      "text": "Correct!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 16.1,
      "end_time": 19.2,
      "text": "With a calm mind, even fire feels cool..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 19.6,
      "end_time": 22.6,
      "text": "I won’t give up from just this level of heat."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 23.4,
      "end_time": 24.4,
      "text": "Hmph♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 25.3,
      "end_time": 27.4,
      "text": "Ahhh, it’s so hot~"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 27.6,
      "end_time": 28.7,
      "text": "Fubuki-chan!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 29.8,
      "text": "I won"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 30.2,
      "end_time": 32.6,
      "text": "Because, as long as one person remains, it's fine, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 33.3,
      "end_time": 35.5,
      "text": "It'll be fine, if it's Yama-sis."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 41.0,
      "end_time": 43.5,
      "text": "Ahh~♡ This is the best~♡"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 45.1,
      "end_time": 46.1,
      "text": "*gulp*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 46.2,
      "end_time": 50.0,
      "text": "I'll share some with you,\nWhen you get out, okay~?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 51.6,
      "end_time": 54.1,
      "text": "You mustn't give in to temptation, Precia-chan!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 54.3,
      "end_time": 56.4,
      "text": "L-let’s do our best...! Oh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 59.1,
      "end_time": 60.6,
      "text": "Happy-chan...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 69.3,
      "end_time": 72.6,
      "text": "Boiled pork, huh? Perfect for a snack."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 73.7,
      "end_time": 77.7,
      "text": "B-but... if we don't prepare it properly..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 78.1,
      "end_time": 80.6,
      "text": "The smell will linger..."
    }
